# qBittorrent-specific, NON-SECRET config. This file IS committed.
#
# Shared values (PUID/PGID/TZ/CONFIG_ROOT/DATA_ROOT) live in ../../common.env.
#
# Categories (movies/tv) and Automatic Torrent Management Mode are set up in
# qBittorrent's own WebUI on first login, not something a compose env var can
# configure. With ATM on, each category saves into its own subfolder under
# DATA_ROOT/torrents/ (TRaSH Guides layout) instead of one flat folder — see
# arr-stack-buildout memory for why this replaces jjserver's flat setup.

# Nothing qBittorrent-specific needed yet.
